&lt;h1&gt;Growth at CFO Insights&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The world’s most demanding investors are busy managing trillions, and ignore anything average. Are you excited by the challenge of making them act?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you looking to work in an exceptional entrepreneurial team with ambitious, motivated and extremely driven people? And do you want real ownership from your first week? If so, now is the time to apply for the Growth role at Private Equity Insights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The mission: build the world&#39;s largest network for private equity investors.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work in sprints and get fast execution under your skin. AI has completely changed the game: You will learn to deploy it to outperform a marketing team of 20+ people, while also learning the fundamentals of copywriting that makes elite investors act, get it to the right investor at a meaningful frequency and deploy what works across every marketing channel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want an ambitious mission, real ownership and the fastest learning curve of your career: apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why CFO Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CFO Insights is Northern Europe’s largest CFO forum and aims to connect and develop CFOs, finance leaders, and tomorrow&#39;s innovators by addressing the issues of the future CFO. We are connecting more than 11,000 professionals from more than 15 countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;CFO Insights is part of United Media which focuses on building large scale industry media and conferences products in sectors such as insurance, HR, private equity, retail, etc. As of today, we have organically launched 8 media companies and acquired one.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Master the highest bar in the world.&lt;/strong&gt; Our audience is the world&#39;s most demanding investors. They ignore anything average. If your work can make them act, you can make anyone act.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unlimited growth potential. &lt;/strong&gt;You will get responsibility before you feel ready. That is how you grow fast. We strongly believe in and have a track record of promoting internally. You can expect coaching and development from leaders, peers and experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Skills that compound for life.&lt;/strong&gt; Fast execution, copywriting, pricing, conversion optimisation, structured problem solving, and the ability to create impact anywhere in the business at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ownership from the very start.&lt;/strong&gt; You own outcomes, not tasks. We agree the goal, and you find the way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Travel opportunity.&lt;/strong&gt; You will be joining our 10+ conferences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Responsibilities in this job will vary, however, feed into the mission: build the world&#39;s largest network for private equity investors. They will be mostly centered around the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the audience.&lt;/strong&gt; Identify, target, and convert every fund into our community, and make sure each one receives the right message, at the right time, and never one too many.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own marketing channels that drive revenue. &lt;/strong&gt;Through existing and new marketing channels, you execute activities that ultimately will drive revenue&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Write copy that persuades.&lt;/strong&gt; Every email, landing page and post. Become the best copywriter and leverage it at scale with AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sprint, test, implement.&lt;/strong&gt; Measure the impact of all experiments you run, test offers, copy, prices and pages until the numbers move.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build systems, not one-offs.&lt;/strong&gt; Anything you do twice becomes a playbook or an AI workflow, so the next win takes less effort than the last.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Do whatever it takes to win.&lt;/strong&gt; Some days that means designing an AI workflow. Some days it means checking investors in at the registration desk at 7am. Nobody here is too good for the work that deliver value for investors and fund managers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we expect from you&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;1 to 3 years of experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Min. a bachelor or master degree with great results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A UK work permit. We do not sponsor visas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong work ethic with a sense of urgency&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional drive and desire to be the best at what you do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive approach and sense of ownership/responsibility of everything you do&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A humble approach and share our passion for building companies and developing people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interested in continuous learning and proactively searching for ways to optimise&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practical details&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Full-time, in person from our London office (WeWork), 5 days a week. Expect to travel for work about 20 days a year. The start date is flexible.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk">Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

